      "@type": "https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap/v0/ns#Process",
      "name": "Sign and publish an IRIS CDN release",
      "summary": "Turn a candidate payload into a signed release on Cloudflare: each changed library item gets a detached JWS over its own manifest, and the BagIt bag (RFC 8493) whose tagmanifest pins every item manifest and signature is signed once with a detached JWS (RFC 75…",
      "description": "Turn a candidate payload into a signed release on Cloudflare: each changed library item gets a detached JWS over its own manifest, and the BagIt bag (RFC 8493) whose tagmanifest pins every item manifest and signature is signed once with a detached JWS (RFC 7515 Appendix F, ES256 per RFC 7518), the key published as a verificationMethod of a did:web DID document whose publicKeyJwk carries an x5c chain to the WHO signing key. Nothing unchanged is re-uploaded or re-signed; an empty diff ends the process with no commit.",
      "enforcement": "strict",
      "sourcePath": "processes/iris-cdn-sign-publish.bpmn",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/litlfred/who-iris/blob/main/processes/iris-cdn-sign-publish.bpmn",
